SN Systems library restoration

The formatter and combined math-support reference comes from adonis-singh/re4,
commit 9b76ff003081d6ece8b838453fb8310743a972c7. See config/GR8E69/sn-library-source.json.
That project does not apply its tooling CC0 license to reconstructed source;
no additional license grant is asserted here.

The formatter derives from Newlib 1.8.2 and retains the Regents of the University
of California notice. This product includes software developed by the University
of California, Berkeley and its contributors. The four math implementations
retain Sun Microsystems notices and permission text. See COPYING.NEWLIB.

Target adaptations and verification used AI assistance.
